        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 8058HLOUS15xUS4, Split Finish Helios Lever with #8 Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Helios Lever with #8 Rosette is perfect for industrialized decor. The Modern Helios Door Lever with Arched #8 Rose is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. The Split Finish Helios Lever with #8 Rosewill fit doors with backsets of either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches and will fit doors 1-1/4 inches to 3 inches thick. This is a split finish leverset. The exterior is US15 Satin Nickel and the interior is US4 Satin Brass.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Helios Lever with #8 Arched Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits standard door cut outs (2-1/8\" pre-drilled doors).</li>\r\n<li>Knob is surface mounted (rosette screws to the door's face).</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Helios Lever with #8 Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Exterior Finish: US15 Satin Nickel</li>\r\n<li>Interior Finish: US4 Satin Brass</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li> Rose Height: 4-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Width: 2-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4 - 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy for Pre-Drilled Doors:</b> No door latch. Door knobs on both sides of the door. Package Includes: 2 knobs, 2 roses, thru-bore dummy mounting kit, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 knobs, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside knob will release privacy push button and retract the door latch. Package Includes: 2 knobs, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
